Give intermittent CI tests more chances

Allow three retries per failed test in the Linux CI pipeline, while
retaining xtest's ten-retry suite budget to limit the cost of widespread
failures. Keep the local default at one retry for faster feedback.

The v0.13.0 commit passed its tag pipeline but failed the main pipeline,
which suggests an intermittent failure. Retrying individual tests avoids
paying for another full build when a transient failure can recover.
